<div class="page-wrap account-page"><div class="eyebrow">PERSONAL LEARNING PROFILE</div><div class="page-heading"><h1>个人中心</h1><p>查看私人笔记、回复提醒、学习进度与个人资料。</p></div><section class="account-summary"><div class="account-avatar" id="account-avatar"><%- icon('book') %></div><div class="account-identity"><h2 id="account-name">正在恢复登录…</h2><p id="account-state" aria-live="polite"></p></div><button class="button" id="sign-in" disabled><%- icon('github') %> 使用 GitHub 登录</button><button class="button secondary" id="sign-out" hidden>退出登录</button></section><div class="account-error" id="account-error" role="alert" hidden></div><section class="panda-account" id="my-panda" aria-label="我的鲨鱼"><h2>我的鲨鱼</h2><p>登录后查看鲨鱼的成长与收藏。</p></section><section id="my-notes" aria-label="我的笔记"><h2>我的笔记</h2><p>登录后管理私人笔记。</p></section><section class="account-quick"><div class="section-heading"><h2>常用入口</h2><span class="muted" id="shortcuts-hint">登录后可调整显示项目</span></div><div class="quick-links" id="account-shortcuts"><a href="/courses/"><%- icon('book') %><span>系统学习</span></a><a href="/topics/"><%- icon('grid') %><span>专题学习</span></a><a href="/commands/"><%- icon('terminal') %><span>Python 速查</span></a><a href="/dictionaries/"><%- icon('file') %><span>研究方法速查</span></a><a href="/programming/"><%- icon('terminal') %><span>Python 实践</span></a><a href="/resources/"><%- icon('download') %><span>资料中心</span></a><a href="/sharing/"><%- icon('book') %><span>实践与分享</span></a><a href="/community/"><%- icon('chat') %><span>讨论中心</span></a></div></section><section id="reply-notifications" class="reply-notifications" aria-label="消息提醒"><div class="reply-notification-heading"><h2>消息提醒 <span class="reply-count" data-reply-count hidden></span></h2><div class="admin-actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-notifications-refresh>刷新</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-notifications-read-all disabled>全部已读</button></div></div><p data-notifications-status role="status">登录后查看收到的回复。</p><div class="reply-notification-list"></div><button type="button" class="button secondary reply-notification-more" hidden>加载更多</button></section><div class="profile-grid"><section class="profile-editor"><h2>基本资料</h2><p class="muted">公开讨论显示你的名称；其余资料仅自己可见。</p><form id="profile-form"><fieldset id="profile-fields" disabled><div class="form-grid"><label class="form-field"><span>显示名称</span><input name="display_name" maxlength="50" required autocomplete="nickname"></label><label class="form-field"><span>单位或学校（选填）</span><input name="institution" maxlength="100" autocomplete="organization"></label></div><label class="form-field"><span>研究方向（选填）</span><input name="research" maxlength="200" placeholder="例如：数据分析、因子研究与回测验证"></label><label class="form-field"><span>当前学习阶段</span><select name="level"><option value="beginner">入门：环境与基本操作</option><option value="intermediate">进阶：信号与回测方法</option><option value="research">应用：组合研究与模型验证</option></select></label><label class="form-field"><span>学习目标（选填）</span><textarea name="bio" maxlength="400" placeholder="写下最近想掌握的方法，或打算完成的实验。"></textarea></label><div class="form-field"><span>常用入口（可多选）</span><div class="shortcut-options"><% [["courses", "系统学习"], ["topics", "专题学习"], ["start", "快速开始"], ["commands", "Python 速查"], ["dictionaries", "研究方法速查"], ["algorithms", "统计与验证"], ["linux", "研究环境"], ["cpp", "Python 基础"], ["programming", "Python 实践"], ["tools", "工具生态"], ["resources", "资料中心"], ["sharing", "实践与分享"], ["community", "讨论中心"], ["assignments", "作业与实践"], ["announcements", "网站公告"]].forEach(([id,label])=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="shortcuts" value="<%= id %>" <%= ["courses", "topics", "commands", "dictionaries", "programming", "resources", "sharing", "community"].includes(id)?'checked':'' %>> <%= label %></label><% }); %></div></div><button class="button" type="submit">保存个人资料</button><p class="form-message" id="profile-message" role="status"></p></fieldset></form></section><aside class="profile-progress"><div class="section-kicker">COURSE PROGRESS</div><h2>学习进度</h2><div class="progress-total"><strong id="account-completed">—</strong><span>个课程单元</span></div><p id="account-progress-state">登录后显示账号的学习记录。</p><div class="progress-track"><span id="account-progress-bar"></span></div><a class="button secondary" href="/courses/" id="account-continue">查看系统课程 →</a><button class="button secondary" id="import-progress" hidden>导入本机学习记录</button><p class="muted">读完一节课，点页面上的“标记为已学”。登录后，进度保存在账号里，换台设备也能看到。</p><div class="profile-links" id="github-personal-links" hidden><h3>公开课堂记录</h3><a id="my-submissions" href="https://github.com/quantlabshark/quantlabshark.github.io/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我的作业提交 ↗</a><a id="my-questions" href="/community/">浏览站内讨论 →</a></div><div class="profile-links"><h3>创作与社区</h3><a href="/studio/">作者工作台 →</a><a href="/community/">讨论中心 →</a><a href="/sharing/">实践与分享 →</a><a href="/admin/" id="profile-admin-link" hidden>网站管理平台 →</a></div></aside></div></div>
